#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:56
msgid ""
"Cap how much AI usage the site can generate and restrict which user roles "
"may trigger paid AI calls. Sits on top of the per-user rate limit (30 "
"requests / minute, hardcoded) that already protects against single-user "
"runaway loops."
msgstr ""
"Batasi penggunaan AI yang dapat dihasilkan situs dan batasi peran pengguna "
"yang dapat memicu panggilan AI berbayar. Terletak di atas batas laju per "
"pengguna (30 permintaan / menit, dikodekan keras) yang sudah melindungi "
"terhadap loop liar pengguna tunggal."

