#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:201
msgid ""
"The API Response Cache stores the raw result of every AI request — "
"translation, meta description, excerpt, and content generation — keyed by a "
"hash of the inputs (content, language pair, provider, model). Subsequent "
"requests with identical inputs are served from the cache with no API call. "
"The cache is different from Translation Memory: Translation Memory operates "
"at the block level and is shared across posts; the API Response Cache "
"operates at the feature level and is keyed per post."
msgstr ""
"Cache Respons API menyimpan hasil mentah dari setiap permintaan AI — "
"terjemahan, deskripsi meta, kutipan, dan pembuatan konten — berdasarkan hash "
"dari input (konten, pasangan bahasa, penyedia, model). Permintaan berikutnya "
"dengan input yang sama disajikan dari cache tanpa panggilan API. Cache ini "
"berbeda dari Memori Terjemahan: Memori Terjemahan beroperasi di tingkat blok "
"dan dibagikan antar posting; Cache Respons API beroperasi di tingkat fitur "
"dan dikunci per posting."

